{"title":"Great Luna Moth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 42 Moth that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 14 times (1.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonwing-dust\">Moonwing Dust</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>439</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>1,269</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>995</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>439</td><td>in the wilds around 1792, 1563</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>1,269</td><td>in the wilds around 1499, 1470</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>995</td><td>in the wilds around 1502, 1461</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"great-luna-moth\" data-map-level=\"43\">Show level 43 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 70 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"moth-silk\" title=\"Moth Silk - in 51 of 70 looted corpses, 45 recorded drops, 98 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d15d8530734f756ad4c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moth Silk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"luna-wing\" title=\"Luna Wing - in 46 of 70 looted corpses, 42 recorded drops, 99 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9dfc6bd97d5a343b2a88.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Luna Wing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 4 of 70 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion La